  "notes": "One TARGET selector read by both grants (Sure Strike's form); the granted trigger's IS_SOURCE is the Goblin that has it (Infernal Scarring's form). Packs: tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/dropkick_bomber_goblin_flies_then_is_sacrificed.json, tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/dropkick_bomber_grant_ends_with_the_turn.json."
